<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cremove</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cremove &lt;member&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cremove fizban
</pre>
<p>Throws a member out of your clan. Only the clan Master and the Lords can 
use it, and nobody can remove the Master. The member doesn't have to be in 
the game: an absent member is struck off the clan's roster.
</p><p>A member who is removed while in the game loses the clan at once: their 
title becomes "Banished from" the clan, and their hometown goes back to the 
temple of Udgaard. To leave a clan yourself, use <a cmd='#'>Help Cdefect</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Caccept</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdefect</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>